{
	"name": "LoadoutMenu",
	"_doc": "The loadout menu (src/client/Menus), Field Grimoire's kit cards (UI overhaul, user 2026-10-30: \"I like ... the kit card loadoats\"): over the live match, dimmed toward the bottom; top left the title, the match currency (Marks), the army and Change team; the soldier you'll spawn as large in the middle with the class under it; top right the live sketch map (src/client/SketchMap) with a red pencil ring round where you'll deploy, named under it; along the bottom one paper card per class (`RowRifleman` is the template, cloned per class and stepped along x by the samples' spacing: `List.axis`): the class's rune, name, blurb and cost; the picked card raised with a red pencil edge, one you can't take faded; Back and Deploy above the cards on torn ink plates, Deploy turning red once you can go. Change team opens the three team cards (each team's flag, name, count / room; white where you can join, red where you can't, grey on your own; a second click joins) in the middle. Sizes in reference pixels at theme.scale.referenceHeight. One font, the game's basic font. Colours: Config/Palette UI.Grimoire, then UI.Settings (the team cards).",
